OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for warehouse dubbed a
OL,4,A'monstrosity' approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a large storage warehouse
OL,7,Fnear a bridge dubbed Britain's most
OL,8,Fbashed have been approved.
OL,10,FHinckley and Bosworth Borough Council's
OL,11,Fplanning committee met last week to
OL,12,Fdiscuss the 95,000 sq ft (8,826 sq m)
OL,13,Fwarehouse, which would sit on land next
OL,14,Fto Hammonds Way and Nutts Lane in
OL,15,FHinckley.
OL,17,FUnder the plans, the industrial unit
OL,18,Fwould operate 24 hours a day, seven
OL,19,Fdays a week, and would result in the
OL,20,Floss of a 2.4-acre green space in the
OL,21,Ftown.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
